  "content": "[Intro 1]\n[Eb/G]\n[Adim/D]\n[Dbm]\n[C6]\n\n[Intro 2]\n[Eb/G]\n[Adim/D]\n[Eb/G]\n[Dbm]\n[C6]\n[Eb/G]\n[Adim/D]\n[Eb/G]\n[Dbm]\n[C6]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D5]The walls of a\npoem [Cm7]\n[D5]like the foldin' of\nwings. [Bb5/F]\n[D5]They burn through the\nbase [Cm7]of the\n[D5]skull.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Em]\n[Dbm]\n[Em]\n[C]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D5]Under the\neyelids [Cm7]\n[D5]the night eter\nnal. [Bb5/F]\n[D5]Down fell the\ncity [Cm7]of\n[D5]words.\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb/G]\n[Adim/D]\n[Eb/G]\n[Dbm]\n[C6]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[D5]The blackness throb\nbin' [Cm7]\n[D5]Foul and unrestrained\n[Bb5/F]\n[D5]Under the seafloor.\n[Cm7]\n[D5]Against the white sand.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Em]Where the\n[Dbm]land has been drinkin'\n[Em]\n[C]All our blood and re-\n[Em]gret Our\n[Dbm]words are like quicksand.\n[Em]A-\n[C]gainst the endless\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb/G]sky.\n[Adim/D]\n[Eb/G]\n[Dbm]\n[C6]\n[Eb/G]The poisonous\ndarkness\n[Adim/D]In solid si\nlence\n[Eb/G]Like rivers in ice.\nWe burn\n[Dbm]like blindin' fires.\n[C6]\n\n[Bridge 1]\n[Ebm]\n[B/Eb]\n[Adim/D]\n[Ebm]\n[B/Eb]\n[Adim/D]\n\n[Bridge 2]\n[Ebm]In the\n[B]void of my spirit.\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]Deep in the lungs of\n[Ebm]Hell to\n[B]sink like\n[Bb]lead.\n[Ebm]In the\n[B]void of my spirit.\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]Deep in the lungs of\n[Ebm]Hell.\n[B]Traceless through the\n[Bb]air.\n\n[Outro 1]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n\n[Outro 2]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n\n[Solo]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n\n[Outro 3]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n\n[Outro 4]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Ebm]\n[B]\n[Bb]\n[Bb/Ab]",
